Z||000004||superXmotorsports||04-20-2000||10:53 PM||||Sorry to reply to this one so late, but Mike Lecompte has a white/blue set and did his needles in red.  He said it looks good that combo and I could have him send you a pic.  What color did you use?  I have been using a red permanent marker on them.  A couple light coats looks like new and still allows the light to pass through.  SXM.||||reg||1
Z||000005||TheFiero64||04-21-2000||06:01 PM||||I scraped the faded orange paint off with a razor, Then I painted it with red model paint. The light still shines on it because I only painted the back. Looks great <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||3
